# Part 2 tables

Source: 1 shard file(s), 8 run summaries. Cells are mean ± sample SD across trained seeds. A dash indicates unavailable data or no episodes with that outcome.

Protocol: `mspacman_maze_pellets_walls_v8`. Training rows: 6/30; transfer rows: 2/10 for the standard five-seed study.

